      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Vt = \u03c0 D\u00b2/4 \u00b7 L           \u2248 77 cm\u00b3\nVw = \u03d5 \u00b7 Vt                \u2248 15 cm\u00b3  (1 PV)\nSolid mass = (1\u2212\u03d5) Vt\u00b7\u03c1\u209b  \u2248 163 g\n\u03c4 = Vw / Q                  \u2248 7.7 hr",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Vt = \u03c0 D\u00b2/4 \u00b7 L           \u2248 77 cm\u00b3\nVw = \u03d5 \u00b7 Vt                \u2248 15 cm\u00b3  (1 PV)\nSolid mass = (1\u2212\u03d5) Vt\u00b7\u03c1\u209b  \u2248 163 g\n\u03c4 = Vw / Q                  \u2248 7.7 hr",
