      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "PVs flushed:   Q \u00b7 t / Vw     \u2248 93\n\u0394NO\u2083\u207b consumed (mol):\n      \u0394NO\u2083\u207b \u00b7 Q \u00b7 t              \u2248 1.4 mmol\n\u0394SOC consumed (mol):\n      5/4 \u00b7 \u0394NO\u2083\u207b \u00b7 Q \u00b7 t      \u2248 1.8 mmol C\n                                          (= 22 mg C)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PVs flushed:   Q \u00b7 t / Vw     \u2248 93\n\u0394NO\u2083\u207b consumed (mol):\n      \u0394NO\u2083\u207b \u00b7 Q \u00b7 t              \u2248 1.4 mmol\n\u0394SOC consumed (mol):\n      5/4 \u00b7 \u0394NO\u2083\u207b \u00b7 Q \u00b7 t      \u2248 1.8 mmol C\n                                          (= 22 mg C)",
