      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "\u0394SOC = (5/4 \u00b7 \u0394NO\u2083\u207b \u00b7 Q \u00b7 t) / [(1\u2212\u03d5) Vt \u00b7 \u03c1\u209b]\n     \u2248 0.011 mol C / kg   (upper bound, fully heterotrophic)\n     \u2248 0.005 mol C / kg   (using observed DIC/NO\u2083\u207b \u2248 0.6, Table 1)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u0394SOC = (5/4 \u00b7 \u0394NO\u2083\u207b \u00b7 Q \u00b7 t) / [(1\u2212\u03d5) Vt \u00b7 \u03c1\u209b]\n     \u2248 0.011 mol C / kg   (upper bound, fully heterotrophic)\n     \u2248 0.005 mol C / kg   (using observed DIC/NO\u2083\u207b \u2248 0.6, Table 1)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
