      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "The predicted depletion\n(\u2248 10 % of the mean TOC)\nis smaller than the measured\nTOC spatial variability across\nthe columns:\n   0.09\u20130.13 mol/kg = \u00b118 %\nA bulk pre/post differential\nTOC measurement at the\ncolumn scale would not\nresolve this signal against\nthe natural sample-to-sample\nheterogeneity.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The predicted depletion\n(\u2248 10 % of the mean TOC)\nis smaller than the measured\nTOC spatial variability across\nthe columns:\n   0.09\u20130.13 mol/kg = \u00b118 %\nA bulk pre/post differential\nTOC measurement at the\ncolumn scale would not\nresolve this signal against\nthe natural sample-to-sample\nheterogeneity.",
